fi story, set in a divergent human future. Inspired by games like Metal Gear Solid, BIRDCAGE touches on futuristic science and technology, political and military power struggles and the nature of the human unconscious mind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode</strong>, the game\u2019s main mode is set across six stages featuring mid-bosses, stage bosses and narrative interludes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158550/extras/542c46d633e1c660e8ed8997f1e25770.poster.avif?t=1752656941\" width=274 height=66 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158550/extras/542c46d633e1c660e8ed8997f1e25770.webm?t=1752656941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158550/extras/542c46d633e1c660e8ed8997f1e25770.mp4?t=1752656941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade Mode</strong> is Story Mode without the narrative, aimed at letting players go after score in a quicker, more convenient way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score Attack</strong> is a race against the clock to chase the highest score, while honing your skills at the game. Enemies spawn endlessly within a set time limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by 90s video games and anime, BIRDCAGE makes use of techniques such as sprite scaling, pre-rendered backgrounds and limited textures to mimic the look of early 3D games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158550/extras/5aaefbc6